  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to La Vida del Sol, a spacious family‑friendly beach retreat with a private heated pool and quick, 100‑step access to the White’s Gulfview Estates private beach boardwalk. Perfect for large or multiple families, this home offers plenty of room to relax, gather, and enjoy the best of 30A.<br><br>Outdoor Living You’ll Love<br>- Private heated pool with lounge chairs, dining area, gas grill & outdoor shower<br>- Large deck overlooking the pool<br>- Covered lanai for shaded relaxation<br>- Two inviting covered porches with wicker seating<br>- Fully fenced for privacy<br><br>Terrace Level<br>- Cozy media room opening directly to the lanai<br>- Queen bedroom + full bath<br>- Sleeper sofa for extra guests<br>- Garage stocked with beach chairs, wagon, floats, bikes, extra fridge, and laundry<br><br>Main Level<br>- Bright, open Great Room, Dining Room & Kitchen<br>- Access to a peaceful front porch—perfect for morning coffee<br>- Queen bedroom and bunk room + full bath<br>- Large deck with pool views<br><br>Upper Level<br>- Private master suite with queen bed, full bath & balcony overlooking the pool<br>Entertainment & Amenities<br>- Four TVs throughout the home, including a 55\" Smart TV with Blu‑ray<br>- Cable and high‑speed WiFi<br>- Fully equipped kitchen<br>- Bikes, beach gear, and plenty of space for everyone<br><br>Prime 30A Location<br>Located on a quiet street in Seacrest Beach, just west of Alys Beach, you’re minutes from:<br>- Scenic 30A’s 18‑mile bike/walking path<br>- Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach & Seaside dining and shopping<br>- Golf courses, coastal dune lakes, parks, markets & outdoor events<br><br>Whether you’re lounging by the pool, strolling to the beach, or exploring 30A, La Vida del Sol offers the perfect setting for your “Life in the Sun.”<br><br>Pets welcome with prior approval (non‑refundable $200 fee). Primary renter must be 25. No student groups. All fees included—no surprises.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
